{"speciesId":881,"names":{"fr":"Galvagla","es":"Arctozolt","en":"Arctozolt","ja":"パッチルドン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Quand la partie supérieure de son corps, couverte de glace, frissonne, il produit de l’électricité. Il éprouve de grandes difficultés à marcher."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"La parte superior del cuerpo está congelada y, al temblar, genera electricidad. Camina con suma dificultad."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"The shaking of its freezing upper half is what generates its electricity. It has a hard time walking around."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"氷漬けの 上半身が 震えると 電気が つくられる。 歩くことが 非常に 苦手。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Autrefois, il vivait en bord de mer et conservait sa nourriture dans la glace de son corps, mais il s’est éteint, car il avait du mal à se déplacer."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Antiguamente vivía en el mar y usaba el hielo del cuerpo para conservar los alimentos. Su extrema lentitud, sin embargo, lo condenó a la extinción."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon lived on prehistoric seashores and was able to preserve food with the ice on its body. It went extinct because it moved so slowly."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"古代の 海辺で 暮らし 餌を 体の 氷で 保存できたが 動きが 鈍いため 絶滅した。"}],"varieties":[{"id":881,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"slam","learns":[[20,"level-up",49]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[20,"level-up",77],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"low-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-shock","learns":[[20,"level-up",1]]},{"